# mv/deps.list
#
# Shared-library dependencies per design/tooling/plan.md §6.3 + §7.
# Each line names one library, its minimum required semver, and the
# mv module(s) that link it. The `pkg install mv` resolver enforces
# the semver constraints before staging the mv package tree under
# /pkgs/mv-1.0.0/; a mismatch (missing or too-old library) is an
# install-time exit 5 (signing/verification failure -- the manifest
# no longer verifies against the installed substrate).
#
# Format: <name> <min-semver>  # <mv module(s)>
#
# Order matches src/ file order (mv, argv, rename, move, inode,
# schema, audit, undo, elevate, verbose, pdxfs) so a reviewer can
# cross-check module-level dependencies against link-list entries.

libpdx-cap             1.0.0   # cap-manifest verify at exec + cap narrowing; src/mv.pdx + src/inode.pdx (signed-inode helpers)
libpdx-argv            1.0.0   # argv surface + flag parse; src/argv.pdx
libpdx-semantic-pipe   1.0.0   # MoveRecord[] schema emit; src/schema.pdx
libpdx-audit           1.0.0   # user-events journal client; src/audit.pdx
libpdx-elevate         1.0.0   # cross-user broker hop; src/elevate.pdx
